    excerpt:
      "Reception desks, retail fixtures, and clinic casework built for NYC buildings — Green Cabinets NY designs and installs commercial millwork by appointment in Brooklyn, Manhattan, and Queens. Call (718) 804-5488.",
    meta_title: "Custom Commercial Millwork for NYC Offices, Retail, and Clinics",
