      "<p>We also work <a href=\"/custom-kitchen-cabinets-brooklyn\">Brooklyn</a> and <a href=\"/custom-kitchen-cabinets-manhattan\">Manhattan</a>. Same millwork, different freight.</p>",
      "<h2>What we actually build</h2>",
