      "<p>Finishes people live with: painted whites, sage, navy, putty, and wood tones in walnut or white oak. Hardware in unlacquered brass, matte black, or brushed nickel. Panel brands we order: Tafisa, Egger, Shinnoki, Wilsonart, AGT. Grain and hardness notes are in the <a href=\"/wood-species\">wood species guide</a>.</p>",
